# arch/arm64/configs/greatlte_l6com.config -- greatlte L6 common (WP-L6COM, FULL_IMAGE_PLAN.md 2.2 row 7): the parts
# several L6 packages share. One fragment per work package, merged after greatlte_l5.config and before
# greatlte_l6t.config. Everything is built in (=y). The SMC helper (EXYNOS8895_SMC) and the sec class
# (SAMSUNG_SEC_CLASS) come with their users' fragments (select / greatlte_l6f.config).

# Samsung SPI controller for spi_3 (codec, L6E) and spi_10 (sensor hub, L6C); owner WP-L6COM (plan X-36,
# L6C 6 row I-14). A:drivers/spi/Kconfig:1002, stock IKC:2235 CONFIG_SPI_S3C64XX=y; CONFIG_SPI=y is in
# gki_defconfig (A:arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig:468). spi_2 (fingerprint, TEE-owned) stays disabled.
CONFIG_SPI_S3C64XX=y
